        <mxCell id="dagster" value="&lt;b&gt;ORCHESTRATION — Dagster (software-defined assets)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;dlt assets  →  @dbt_assets (one Dagster asset auto-generated per dbt model)  →  dbt tests as asset checks&lt;br&gt;`dagster dev` locally   ·   webserver + daemon in Docker Compose on a GCP e2-micro VM   ·   daemon holds the daily schedule&lt;br&gt;GitHub Actions builds and deploys the image; UI reached over an IAP tunnel (ingress is IAP-only)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff4e6;strokeColor=#e8590c;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#212529;" vertex="1" parent="1">
